title: "Open Science in Practice: An Implementation Guide for Researchers"
abstract: >
  A community-built, discipline-spanning handbook for adopting open-science
  practices in research and lab management, produced by the DePaul University
  2025-26 Scholarship Learning Community on Open Science in Practice.
